{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-12_beg","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":249,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_main_16-12_beg","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"16-12","storyName":"深埋地底","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在由“奥卡”构成的瀑布前，Mon3tr发现了这种流体的本质。博士在矿洞中捕捉到了普瑞赛斯邀请自己继续“辨论”的意图。而在矿洞更深处，变异的裂兽发出了嘶号。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_16-12_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_16-11","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["科谢尼娅","Mon3tr"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"前面就是第一次发现“奥卡”的矿洞了。","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"按理说，在那不久之后这里就被严格管控起来了......但是现在看来，像是完全废弃了。","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"不过，好消息是矿洞里的活性源石粉尘含量也在停工后迅速下降了，只要不去直接接触失去活性的源石结晶，不会有太大的感染风险。","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#10$1","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，我没有检测到别的生命信号——看上去不用打架就可以进去了。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":16},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"19","text":"我们尚不清楚这里是什么情况。"},"2":{"id":"19","text":" 纠察队和卫兵随时都有可能回来。"}},"values":[],"id":18},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":19},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"21","text":"抓紧时间。"},"2":{"id":"21","text":"我们快去快回。"}},"values":[],"id":20},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":21,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":22},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"科谢尼娅，你确定是这个方向吗？","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我什么也没看到。","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"抱歉，我只下来过一次......","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"让我先找找应急能源开关的位置。","id":30},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"哦，在这儿。","id":33},{"type":"dialog","id":34},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":35},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_spotlightc","id":36},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":37},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":38},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":39},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#9$1","duration":"0.5","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"呼，看来没错。接下来继续往矿车运行的反方向走就行。","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"反方向？我以为我们要下到更深处去。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"前面连接的是其他地方，并不是矿洞。我也不知道那边具体是做什么的，但应该只走货物不走人。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"矿车呢？还能用吗？","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_goldbarhit","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"矿车本身没有问题，但被搁置太久了，应急能源大概只够提供照明，我们还是不去尝试的好。","id":53},{"type":"dialog","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":55},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"57","text":"没错。"},"2":{"id":"57","text":" 我们走下去就行。"}},"values":[],"id":56},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":57,"end":64},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#4$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"唔。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#10$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"你们两个，上矿车。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"什么？","id":64,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":65},{"type":"charslot","id":66},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"68","text":"矿车里可没有安全带！"},"2":{"id":"68","text":"我们可以自己走下去！"}},"values":[],"id":67},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":68,"end":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#10$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"上矿车，博士。这样节省时间。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"但矿车启动不了——","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#10$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"别担心，我来解决。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，需要我扶你上去吗？","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-10$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":77},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"79","text":"......我自己来！"}},"values":[],"id":78},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":79,"end":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","id":82},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":84},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"准备好了吗？","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"可是，Mon3tr小姐，你准备做什——","id":87,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":88},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":89},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tramcarwheel_loop","loop":"true","channel":"kc","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":91},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"kc","fadetime":"0.5","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"——呃？！","id":93},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"97","text":"我们绝对会被晃飞出去。"},"2":{"id":"97","text":"矿车绝对会被你弄散架的。"}},"values":[],"id":96},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":97,"end":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我保证不会的，你们坐稳就行。","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我们要出发了！","id":99,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"100","block":"false","id":101},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":102},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tramcarwheel_loop","loop":"true","channel":"kc","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"还好，矿洞看上去还正常，没有出现坍塌。","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"不过......下来之前我们应该先烤烤火的。矿洞深处的湿度比外面要高许多，几乎是伊比利亚沿海和乌萨斯内陆的区别。","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"当然，矿井内外的温差也很大......你们感觉还好吗？","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我当然没什么问题啦。博士呢？","id":108},{"type":"dialog","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":110},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"112","text":"感觉......感觉我的脑子被晃得很均匀。"},"2":{"id":"112","text":"Mon3tr，你好像玩得很开心！"}},"values":[],"id":111},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":112,"end":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我控制速度了啊？","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"Mon3tr小姐是一位很好的驾驶员，或者说推车工人。","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"哼，看来不是我的问题。","id":115,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"119","text":"科谢尼娅，我有一个问题。"},"2":{"id":"119","text":"矿区第一次发现“奥卡”是什么时候？"}},"values":[],"id":118},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":119,"end":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"具体时间我并不清楚，在一个月前，第一份“奥卡”样本才被送到研究所。","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"那也是我知道源石矿井中出现这种......闻所未闻的新物质的时刻。","id":121,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":123},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"125","text":"可是很奇怪......"}},"values":[],"id":124},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":125},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"127","text":"像这种矿井中出现的物质......"},"2":{"id":"127","text":"研究所是如何把它和“人体实验”联系起来的？"}},"values":[],"id":126},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":127,"end":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"就在这个发现了“奥卡”的矿洞里，感染者出现了匪夷所思的异变。","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"感染者的感染程度奇高无比的同时，却保持着正常的生命体征，甚至算得上“健康”......","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"症状听起来很熟悉。","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"你们在别的地方也遇到了这样的病人？他们也接触过“奥卡”？","id":131,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":133},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"135","text":"或许还有别的可能。"},"2":{"id":"135","text":"我们还不能确定......"}},"values":[],"id":134},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":135,"end":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"总之......乌萨斯官方想要复制这样的“奇迹”。","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我猜，他们是想要不惧病痛、不会反抗的劳动力，甚至是......另一种特殊的军队。","id":137,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"charslot","id":139},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"141","text":"乌萨斯官方会有这样的反应并不令人意外......"},"2":{"id":"141","text":"他们还没有意识到这样做的危害。"}},"values":[],"id":140},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":141,"end":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，科谢尼娅，我们好像接近了。","id":142},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":143},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"kc","fadetime":"1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"矿车的轨道就到这里了，接下来我们得步行了。","id":145,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":146},{"type":"text","text":"三人摸黑徒步向前走去。","id":147},{"type":"dialog","id":148},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":150},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":151},{"type":"text","text":"比光线先进入知觉的依然是声音。水声，滞重的水声。","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"charslot","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":156},{"type":"curtain","id":157},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","fadetime":"3","channel":"bgs","id":158},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"text","text":"三人抬起头，缓慢睁开眼睛。","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"他们很快意识到洞内的光亮并不来自外界，它来自眼前地上静止不动的液体，以及视线尽头淋漓的——瀑布。","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"液体有着黑曜石般的光泽，在下落过程中折射从高处缝隙中透出的光亮，让洞窟崎岖的内部明亮得如同下过小雨的清晨。","id":164},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":165,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialog","id":166},{"type":"charslot","id":167},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"169","text":"......逆向河。"}},"values":[],"id":168},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":169,"end":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"你看出来了？","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"是的，类似逆向河，“奥卡”本应溢出的部分无法沿倾斜面向外流淌，因此只能往回流，直到像这样“静止”。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"但它其实保持着某种程度上的流动性，即使没有外力影响。这可能也是他们把它命名为“奥卡”的原因，像河流一样。","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这里到处都是这种液体。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"根本看不出这里是矿洞，简直就像是一个天然溶洞。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"更神奇的是，“奥卡”本身，就像是水一样。","id":179,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":181},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"183","text":"这是什么意思？"},"2":{"id":"183","text":"这怎么可能？"}},"values":[],"id":182},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":183,"end":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"不......只是一个比方。","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"沉淀一段时间之后，“奥卡”呈现出的状态非常稳定，甚至可以被当作通用溶剂使用。","id":186},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$1","id":187},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"请等一下！就算是这样我们也不能直接用手去接触——","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#7$1","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"啊......","id":191},{"type":"charslot","id":192,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_water","loop":"true","channel":"w","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":195},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"0","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr弯腰，用试管从地上收集起一些液体。她没戴手套，也未做任何防护。","id":197},{"type":"text","text":"湿漉漉的双手晃动着试管中的液体，她的表情凝重起来。","id":198},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"charslot","id":200},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"202","text":"Mon3tr？"}},"values":[],"id":201},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":202,"end":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"Mon3tr小姐，你不该直接接触——我带了防护设备，你想要样本的话可以告诉我，让我来采集！","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（小声）......博士，我知道这是什么了。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#8$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"什么？","id":208,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":210},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"212","text":"......"}},"values":[],"id":211},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":212},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"214","text":"科谢尼娅，样本采集......"},"2":{"id":"214","text":"那能麻烦你去采集一下瀑布那边的样本吗？"}},"values":[],"id":213},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":214,"end":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#1$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"啊，可以。","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"你们就在这里等我，我很快回来。","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#4$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"......要小心。","id":219,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shallowswalk","loop":"true","channel":"w1","id":221},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":223},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w1","fadetime":"0.5","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":226},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这种被称为“奥卡”的流体......实际上就是“源石”。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":230},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"232","text":"源石......"},"2":{"id":"232","text":"为什么会是这个样子？"}},"values":[],"id":231},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":232,"end":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这解释起来稍微有些复杂。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，你还记得莱茵生命研究的“递质”，或者伊比利亚炼金术中常被提及的“心相原质”吗？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":237},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"239","text":"我记得。"},"2":{"id":"239","text":"它们之间有关系？"}},"values":[],"id":238},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":239,"end":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这可能就是它们的原型，或者说原始素材。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":243},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"245","text":"“递质”和“心相原质”的共通点......"},"2":{"id":"245","text":"它们都是某种“媒介”。"}},"values":[],"id":244},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":245,"end":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"没错，能直接与人体产生反应，或留存信息的“媒介”。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":249},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"251","text":"所以这两种产物才都呈现为流体？"}},"values":[],"id":250},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":251,"end":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我认为是这样的......","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，你应该已经了解，源石既是“信息”的载体，也是“能量”的载体。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#4$1","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"“递质”与“心相原质”，都是用特定的手段重新刻录了源石能量，用以保留不同信息的产物。","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"而出现在这里的“奥卡”，是以一种更高效的手段抽空了源石中的能量后，残余的空白物质......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"所以，它甚至真的就是一种“通用溶剂”。或许这也可以解释那些接触过“奥卡”的感染者为何会出现“变异”。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"简单来说，“奥卡”作为一种失去了能量的源石，中和了感染者体内的源石活性，同时也为源石的持续生长创造了前所未有的优越条件。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这或许能暂时维持感染者的生命体征，但是无法改变他们注定很快就会死去的结果。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#9$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"而那些被注入了“奥卡”的普通人，由于体内几乎毫无活性源石，产生了强烈的排异反应，所以无一幸存......","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-9$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":265},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"267","text":"它大规模出现在这里......"},"2":{"id":"267","text":"那就意味着......"}},"values":[],"id":266},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":267,"end":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#9$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这就是我们最应该担忧的事......","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，科罗萨主矿脉正在枯竭。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-9$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":272},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"274","text":"......"},"2":{"id":"274","text":"......"},"3":{"id":"274","text":"......"}},"values":[],"id":273},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2","3"],"id":274,"end":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我们听到的那些传闻，乌萨斯正在加快开采源石的速度......实际上是在掩饰矿脉枯竭的事实。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"从这里，乌萨斯最北端的矿区开始，枯竭的速度还会不断加快。","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我可以大概估算出，四个月之内，乌萨斯境内的源石矿储量将会下降到原有的百分之三十......","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":280},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"282","text":"这才是女大公封锁矿区的真正原因。"},"2":{"id":"282","text":"这件事根本不可能一直隐瞒下去。"}},"values":[],"id":281},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":282,"end":284},{"type":"text","text":"甚至不用问出那个问题，你和Mon3tr对视，脑海中不约而同地浮现出一个名字。","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"那唯一一个有能力做到这件事的人的名字——","id":284,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"287","text":"普瑞赛斯。"}},"values":[],"id":286},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":287,"end":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"除了她，也不可能有其他人了。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":291},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"293","text":"她为什么要这样做？"}},"values":[],"id":292},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":293,"end":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"矿脉枯竭的进程无法被干涉，也无法被逆转。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"乌萨斯必定会走向崩溃。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":298},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"300","text":"恐怕不只是乌萨斯。"}},"values":[],"id":299},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":300},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"302","text":"这种体量的资源枯竭必然会影响整个泰拉。"}},"values":[],"id":301},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":302},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"304","text":"难道这就是她想要的？"}},"values":[],"id":303},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":304,"end":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，博士！我想到了。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"“奥卡”也是前文明的遗留......还是你们曾经实验的副产物。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#4$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"如果矿脉枯竭是因为她做了些什么，那这里面可能存在一些有用的信息。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，你试试看能不能读取。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":313},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"315","text":"我该怎么......？"}},"values":[],"id":314},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":315,"end":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#2$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"现在条件有限，直接把你的手放进去，就像我刚才采集样本时那样。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"放心，它不会对你产生伤害的。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":319,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":321},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_water","loop":"true","channel":"w","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":323},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"0","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"依着Mon3tr的指示，你蹲下身去，把双手都沉入名为“奥卡”的液体当中。","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"你等待了一会儿。","id":326},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"329","text":"没感觉到有什么不同。"}},"values":[],"id":328},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":329,"end":332},{"type":"text","text":"你等待着变化，或者回应，就像先前数次发生过的“奇迹”一样。","id":330},{"type":"text","text":"然而最终却什么也没有发生。","id":331},{"type":"text","text":"来自前文明的产物似乎在拒绝、否认你们之间存在某种联系。","id":332,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":333},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"335","text":"我们脚下这些会不会已经失去储存信息的功能了？"},"2":{"id":"335","text":"或者说，她根本没有想留给我们的信息。"}},"values":[],"id":334},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":335,"end":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"......唔，不是没可能。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":338},{"type":"charslot","id":339},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walk_water","loop":"true","channel":"ww","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":341},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#6$1","duration":"0.5","id":342},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":343},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ww","fadetime":"0","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"Mon3tr小姐，博士！","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"快过来，我发现了一些新东西！","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"在瀑布后面有个空洞，爬上去，站到那里——","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4208_wintim_1#4$1","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我发现矿洞中存在一种特殊频率的声音，它很不自然——不，是绝对不自然！","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"就仿佛......它在试图通过声波传达某种信息！","id":350},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"啊......？","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"356","text":"我们去看看。"}},"values":[],"id":355},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":356,"end":357},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":357,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":358},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":359},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":360},{"type":"charslot","id":361},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":362},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magneticwaterfall_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":363},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":364},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","volume":"1","id":367},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_glow_42i11_01","layer":"1","x":"-600","y":"-400","id":368},{"type":"image","image":"66_i06","fadetime":"3","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","screenadapt":"coverall","id":369},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"60","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":371},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":372,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_airbuzz_1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"这是——","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"瀑布中间还有这样的地方？","id":376},{"type":"dialog","id":377},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"379","text":"确实......很壮观。"}},"values":[],"id":378},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":379,"end":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"来，你们仔细听！在所有液体击打岩石的声音里，总有几段频率特别的声音，仿佛在吸引人注意。它们非常不同，你们一定能听见！","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我刚才有试着解读我听到的那几段，这花了一些时间，因为要把时高时低的声音完全记录下来——","id":381,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":382},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_airbuzz_2","id":383},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"就是这个！你们听到了吗？","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我只听到了雨声！甚至听不清你说话——","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士？","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"你只是闭上了双眼，任由所有的声音将你包裹。","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"直到明确听到了那不断变换频率的声音。","id":389},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_airbuzz_3","id":391},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":392},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"394","text":"我......"}},"values":[],"id":393},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":394},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"396","text":"我听见了。"}},"values":[],"id":395},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":396,"end":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"——你是说你听见了吗——","id":397,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_airbuzz_4","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":400},{"type":"text","text":"那些陡然闯入知觉的声音，时而由数段频率高的声波组成，时而简短且凌厉，像一张韵调别致的乐谱。","id":401},{"type":"text","text":"但你很快就确定，它理应是某种编码，或者是语言。","id":402},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_airbuzz_5","id":403},{"type":"text","text":"你尽力捕捉了自己能忆起的所有语言，将它们分门别类，一一对应之后，你意识到这只是同个词语在不同语言中的变体。","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"好吧，我抄写下来了......","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"虽然只是直觉，但如果按照不同移动城市之间使用的通用编码规则来识别这些声音......","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我觉得它应该是一个单词，是用很多语言写出来的同一个单词。我可以认出乌萨斯语和高卢语！我觉得这两个词的意思都是——","id":407},{"type":"dialog","id":408},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":409},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"charslot","id":411},{"type":"image","id":412},{"type":"bgeffect","id":413},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":414},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":415},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":416},{"type":"sticker","id":417,"text":"“未知语言”","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":418,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":419},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"sticker","id":422,"text":"“спорить”","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":423,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":424},{"type":"sticker","id":425,"text":"“dibattito”","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":426,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":427},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":428},{"type":"dialog","id":429},{"type":"sticker","id":430,"text":"“débat”","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":431,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":432},{"type":"sticker","id":433,"text":"“debate”","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1"},{"type":"sticker","id":434,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":435},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":436},{"type":"text","text":"是的。留在矿井中的流体用敲击岩石的形式向你传递了同一个词语——","id":437},{"type":"dialog","id":438},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":439},{"type":"dialog","id":440},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":441},{"type":"charslot","id":442},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_bg_white.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":443},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":444},{"type":"sticker","id":445,"text":"<color=#000000>“辩论”。</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":446,"text":"<color=#000000>“辩论”。</color>","x":"320","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"30","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"false","duration":"3"},{"type":"dialog","id":447},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_jumpscare","volume":"0.6","id":448},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_blackmask","layer":"1","id":449},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":450},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":451},{"type":"charslot","id":452},{"type":"sticker","id":453},{"type":"sticker","id":454},{"type":"bgeffect","id":455},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_bg_bg_0_rhodes3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":456},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":457},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":458},{"type":"text","text":"是了，Dr.{@nickname}。","id":459},{"type":"text","text":"如果你依然认为自己的选择是正确的。","id":460},{"type":"text","text":"如果你依然坚定地相信你描述的未来。","id":461},{"type":"text","text":"那就用现实来驳斥我，向我证明......","id":462},{"type":"text","text":"你坚持的......","id":463},{"type":"dialog","id":464},{"type":"sticker","id":465,"text":"“希望”。","x":"300","y":"340","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.001","width":"700","block":"true","duration":"1.5"},{"type":"sticker","id":466,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"dialog","id":467},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":468},{"type":"charslot","id":469},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":470},{"type":"image","image":"66_i06","id":471},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":472,"musicid":3},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magneticwaterfall_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":473},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":474},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":475},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"477","text":"......这是一个邀请。"}},"values":[],"id":476},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":477,"end":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"你说什么？","id":478,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":479},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"481","text":"我说，这是一个邀请。"}},"values":[],"id":480},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":481},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"483","text":"一个我必须接受的邀请。"}},"values":[],"id":482},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":483,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":484},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":485},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":486},{"type":"charslot","id":487},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":488},{"type":"image","id":489},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":490},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":491},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":492},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":493},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（小声）你认为这是普瑞赛斯留给你的信息？","id":495,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":496},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":497},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"499","text":"是的。"},"2":{"id":"499","text":" 我明白她的意思......"}},"values":[],"id":498},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":499},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"501","text":"我们应该尽快撤离了。"}},"values":[],"id":500},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":501,"end":504},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"等科谢尼娅采集完样本，我们就回研究所吧。","id":503,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"得想个办法和阿米娅他们取得联络......","id":504,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":505},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":506},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"508","text":"不知道阿米娅他们怎么样了。"},"2":{"id":"508","text":" 希望阿米娅已经和Raidian他们取得联系了。"}},"values":[],"id":507},{"type":"predicate","references":["1","2"],"id":508,"end":512},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":509},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_giantmonster_treadwater","loop":"true","channel":"gf","id":510},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":511},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"gf","fadetime":"0.3","id":512,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":513},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":514},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"516","text":"......你有没有听到什么声音？"}},"values":[],"id":515},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":516,"end":518},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"什么样的声音？","id":518,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":519},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":520},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"522","text":"重物踩在水里移动的声音。"}},"values":[],"id":521},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":522,"end":526},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#1$1","id":523},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"瀑布的水声一直挺大的。","id":524,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","id":525},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，你确定不是耳鸣吗？也许是因为刚才需要你大脑同时处理的信息太多，知觉滞留......","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":527},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":528},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_giantmonster_treadwater","loop":"true","channel":"gf","id":529},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":530},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"gf","fadetime":"0.3","id":531},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#5$1","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"......等等。","id":533,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"科谢尼娅？是你吗？","id":534,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":535},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":536},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"538","text":"那不是科谢尼娅的脚步声，体重和节奏都不对。"}},"values":[],"id":537},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":538,"end":541},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4179_monstr_1#8$1","id":539},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"那是......什么——","id":540,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4179_monstr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":541,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":542},{"type":"charslot","id":543},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sandfall_01","layer":"1","y":"350","id":544},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":545},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_giantmonster_treadwater","id":546},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$shatterpoint_01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act27d0d0/m_bat_shatterpoint_01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":547,"musicid":4},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stonegrowing","volume":"1","id":548},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":549},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_66_i11_1","style":"cg","pfrom":"-400,0","pto":"-400,0","pduration":"2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"0.5","layer":"3","id":550},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":551},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"0.3","block":"false","id":552},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.07","fadetime":"0.3","id":553},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.07","fadetime":"0.3","id":554},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":555},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_66_i11_2","style":"cg","pfrom":"400,0","pto":"400,0","pduration":"2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"0.5","layer":"2","id":556},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":557},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":558},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"0.3","block":"false","id":559},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.07","fillto":"0.14","fadetime":"0.3","id":560},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.07","fillto":"0.14","fadetime":"0.3","id":561},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":562},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"50","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":563},{"type":"image","image":"66_i11","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.15","yScale":"1.15","id":564},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":565},{"type":"background","id":566},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1.7","yScaleTo":"1.7","duration":"0.6","id":567},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_giantmonster_growl","volume":"1","id":568},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.14","fillto":"0","fadetime":"1","id":569},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.14","fillto":"0","fadetime":"1","id":570},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"50","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":571},{"type":"image","image":"66_i11","fadetime":"1","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","id":572},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleTo":"1.3","duration":"60","id":573},{"type":"delay","time":"5","id":574},{"type":"text","text":"癫狂的呼号，急促的呼吸，獠牙之间的黏液不断滴穿水面。","id":575},{"type":"text","text":"暗红的源石贯穿了它整个身躯，似乎是由于这坚硬的钳制，才使它必须像人一样站立。","id":576},{"type":"text","text":"而后，你看到它擎起巨大的前掌——","id":577},{"type":"text","text":"不，不能说是前掌。因为那完全是一双干枯的、人的双手。","id":578},{"type":"dialog","id":579},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":580},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"582","text":"......被源石感染的裂兽。"}},"values":[],"id":581},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":582,"end":586},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":583},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"我采集完样本了！","id":584},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"你们......怎么站在这里不动？","id":585},{"type":"text","text":"与认知不符的怪异裂兽正站在她身后。","id":586,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":587},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":588},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"590","text":"科谢尼娅，快过来！"}},"values":[],"id":589},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":590,"end":600},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"跑，科谢尼娅！往前跑，不要回头看！","id":591},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"我得去带她回来。博士，你去矿车那边，我们在那里会合！","id":592},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"博士，快走！","id":593},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"什——","id":594},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shallowsrun","volume":"1","id":595},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"5","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":596},{"type":"text","text":"研究员奔跑起来的同时，忍不住回过头去。","id":597},{"type":"text","text":"她只来得及咽下尖叫。","id":598},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"——陛下在上——","id":599},{"type":"dialogue","name":"科谢尼娅","text":"那究竟是什么东西？！","id":600,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":601},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":602},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":603},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":604},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"20","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":605},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":606},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":607},{"type":"image","id":608},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":609}],"characters":["科谢尼娅","Mon3tr"]}